{:title "THE MAP, the Complete Vision of Smile in My Own Words",
 :description
 "How THE MAP became the complete vision of the Smile Prompt Language, a map of short bullets in my own words, changed only by proposals in its own format, gathering every amendment, and from October 2026 the live source every instance reads, with THE MAP Viewer to see and edit it, with every source.",
 :keywords
 "THE MAP, Smile vision document, product vision in the founder's words, amendments, THE MAP Viewer, Smile prompt language, history of Smile",
 :lede
 "THE MAP is the complete vision of Smile, composed of my own words. It is the live source every instance and every person reads, and every idea spoken about Smile is meant to land in it.",
 :paras
 ["THE MAP is written in short bullets and sections, with ~ lines for what is true of a section and - lines for its parts. It is changed only by proposals written in its own format and read whole before they land, and its amendments are kept beside it until they do. From October 2026 it is seen and edited on THE MAP Viewer, and every amendment, note and prompt met anywhere is asked to be brought there as a change still to land, my words kept exactly. Most posts in this series begin from what THE MAP says their feature is."
 "THE MAP became the centre of the work on 5 August 2026. “surely registering everything in the map and building off that is the way”, and “there is meant to be a map formatted simply with - bullets”.[[m:2026-08-05]] On 9 August, “the recent revelation of ontological \"lenses\" as the first name of the project we have truly decided.”, with the way it is changed, “Please don't immediately adjsut the map like that. read it fully and discuss with me your proposed changes”.[[m:2026-08-09]]"
 "Between 10 and 13 August I set how THE MAP is read and written. “so propose map edits to me in the maps original format, with short bullet sand sections”.[[m:2026-08-10]] “never propose parts. give me a proposal of the full map with all the ideas integrated”, and “I want all the features and requirements of the vision of Smile.”[[m:2026-08-11]] A writing guide and a meta-writing guide followed, “please !!(-: always :-) provide the full map with writing prompt for each feedback”, and “use \"e.g.\" not -”.[[m:2026-08-12]] And on 13 August, “everything i tell you i hope you integrate into documents”.[[m:2026-08-13]]"
 "From September the amendments gathered. On 4 September, “I need you to write this into your pending THE FINAL MAP corrections”.[[m:2026-09-04]] On 5 September, “no we dotn edit the map directly.”[[m:2026-09-05]] On 30 September, “You need to integrate every single idea ever spoken about in”, “the project into one single coherent whole.”[[m:2026-09-30]] On 2 October, “Propose for every proposed amendment a proposed change in THE MAP.md”.[[m:2026-10-02]] On 8 October, “Integrate all this into a new final THE MAP we can use as the complete vision doc”.[[m:2026-10-08]]"
 "In October THE MAP was given its viewer and its place. On 11 October, “get me a viewer for the map and its changes that i can edit each change”, and “THE MAP is only related to Smile friend.”[[m:2026-10-11]] On 13 October, “we are now always prioritizing THE MAP, and it will be our constant live source”, for every person and agent,[[m:2026-10-13]] and the reminder of what it is made of, “you know THE MAP is only my verbatim words composed right?”[[m:2026-10-13#2]] On 15 October, “Get me THE MAP viewer and editor with all proposed changes, features, specs etc integrated from all past instances”.[[m:2026-10-15]]"
 "So THE MAP moved from a map of bullets to build from in August 2026, through a guide for how it is written and a gathering of amendments, to the live source of the whole vision with its own viewer, across {{moments}} moments and {{quotes}} quotes from {{first}} to {{last}}. The handbook a model reads to write Smile is followed in [[t:master-header]], and the purpose THE MAP opens with in [[t:what-smile-is-for]]."],
